  {
    "chinese": "雕塑家说，他在石头中看到了一个等待着被释放的形象。",
    "english": "The sculptor says he sees a figure waiting to be released in the stone.",
    "soundmark": "/ðə ˈskʌlptər sez hiː siːz ə ˈfɪgər ˈweɪtɪŋ tuː bi rɪˈliːst ɪn ðə stəʊn/",
