  {
    "chinese": "每一件雕塑作品都是艺术家内心世界的外在表达。",
    "english": "Every sculpture is an outward expression of the artist's inner world.",
    "soundmark": "/ˈevri ˈskʌlptʃər ɪz ən ˈaʊtwəd ɪkˈspreʃən ɒv ði ˈɑːtɪsts ˈɪnər wɜːld/",
