  {
    "chinese": "创作过程需要耐心、技巧和无限的想象力。",
    "english": "The creative process demands patience, skill, and boundless imagination.",
    "soundmark": "/ðə kriˈeɪtɪv ˈprɒses dɪˈmɑːndz ˈpeɪʃns skɪl ənd ˈbaʊndləs ɪˌmædʒɪˈneɪʃn/",
