  {
    "chinese": "他相信材料本身会告诉他该做成什么形状。",
    "english": "He believes the material itself tells him what shape to make it.",
    "soundmark": "/hiː bɪˈliːvz ðə məˈtɪəriəl ɪtˈself telz hɪm wɒt ʃeɪp tuː meɪk ɪt/",
